# Hard Constraints & Operational Protocol

## 1. Visual Identity
- strictly follow `DESIGN.md`.
- Canvas: `#0b0f10`, Panel: `#101415`, Card: `#181c1d`, Accent: `#10b981`.
- Zero design slop: no generic gradients, no white backgrounds, no low-contrast borders.

## 2. Technical Architecture
- Framework: Next.js 14 App Router.
- Type Safety: Strict TypeScript. No `any`. Use interfaces from `@/types/content.ts`.
- Content: Sourced from `@/data/curriculum.ts`. No hardcoded content in pages.
- Client Components: All interactive elements (`useState`, `useEffect`) must have `'use client'`.

## 3. Asset Management
- Use inline SVGs for missing diagrams to avoid 404s.
- Ensure 16:9 ratio for all `FigureCard` components.

## 4. Performance
- Use `generateStaticParams()` for SSG.
- Optimize images and fonts for Bio-Informatics aesthetic.
